{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.108:1.1"], "en": "“At two hundred years of age,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.108:1.2"], "en": "I went forth into homelessness.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.108:1.3"], "en": "“The three true insights have been attained;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.108:1.4"], "en": "the Buddha’s teaching has been accomplished.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.108:1.5"], "en": "… Thus spoke the Elder Dhammasavaṇī.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"}
